- **Database, CQRS & Idempotency Key**: `.agents/rules/04-database-and-cqrs.md`
- **Observability (OTel, AsyncLocalStorage Trace Correlation)**: `.agents/rules/05-observability-otel.md`
- **Testing Strategy (70/20/10 & AAA Pattern)**: `.agents/rules/06-testing-strategy.md`
- **Git & PR Governance (Trunk-Based, Conventional Commits)**: `.agents/rules/07-git-branch-and-pr.md`
- **DevOps & IaC (Distroless, Non-Root, Terraform State)**: `.agents/rules/08-devops-and-iac.md`
- **Frontend Engineering (State Triad, RHF+Zod, Skeleton CLS)**: `.agents/rules/09-frontend-engineering.md`
- **Monolith vs Microservices (ADR, Outbox, Saga, Circuit Breaker)**: `.agents/rules/10-monolith-vs-microservices.md`
- **Computational Complexity & Metrics (Big-O, CWV, RED, USE)**: `.agents/rules/11-computational-complexity-and-metrics.md`

